<title>USA: Capcom unit to halt production of game.</title>
<headline>Capcom unit to halt production of game.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capcom Co Ltd's Capcom Entertainment Monday said that it will cease production and shipment of its 'Resident Evil' computer game on March 31.</p>
<p>The game, which can be played on Sony Corp's popular PlayStation game machine, has sold more than two million units worldwide.</p>
<p>Capcom said 'Resident Evil 2' is currently scheduled to be released in the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
